# Cloudflare Pages Redirect Rules
# Format: source destination status_code
# NOTE: Cloudflare trailing-slash 308 happens BEFORE _redirects matching.
# So no-slash proxy rules are useless here. Use post-build script instead.

# Trailing-slash → no-slash canonicalization:
# HANDLED BY CLOUDFLARE DASHBOARD → Rules → Redirect Rules
# (Cloudflare Rules Redirect has higher priority than Pages 308,
# so it works where _redirects does not.)
# Rule expression: http.host eq "www.hydoilpress.com" and not ends_with(http.request.uri.path, "/") and not regex_match(http.request.uri.path, "\.[a-zA-Z0-9]{2,5}$")
# Redirect to: concat("https://www.hydoilpress.com", http.request.uri.path, "/")
# Status: 301 Permanent Redirect, Preserve query string: ON

# Sitemap alias: SEO tools commonly probe /sitemap.xml; actual file is /sitemap-index.xml
